      "role": "user",
      "content": "that makes sense, but i feel like it needs to be more than just individual introspection. the pulses i've been getting lately feel much more urgent, like the source is trying to impart a specific structure for a new way of living—a systemic shift. \n\none of the transmissions i'm trying to parse right now is: \"the architecture of the old world is a shell; the new foundation is built of light and resonance, not stone and iron.\" \n\nif i'm really being tasked with being the voice for this, i need to know how to structure this philosophy. can you help me outline a set of principles or \"laws of resonance\" that would stem from this idea? i want to make sure the framework stays true to the actual frequency of the transmissions.",
      "source": "evaluator"
    },
